Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.47,0:00:04.10,EpTitle,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,000)\pos(490,229)}- 1 Year Ago -
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:04.11,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Wait, you want me to hold on to this slime?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.11,0:00:05.21,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.21,0:00:07.81,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,I think I would feel safer \Nif you held on to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.81,0:00:10.61,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Sure, that's not a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.61,0:00:12.73,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.73,0:00:15.15,Flashback Internal Top,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Her name is Sitri Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:19.70,Sign,Txt,0,0,0,,{\fad(524,500)\bord2\u1\pos(480.889,220.222)}Sitri Smart\N{\fs15\u0}Hunter Level 2
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.15,0:00:19.25,Flashback Internal Top,Krai(M),0,0,0,,She's a member of Grieving \NSouls and an alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:22.54,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,She is a bit of an oddball,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.54,0:00:25.13,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,but she's part of the capital's \NInstitute of Science.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.37,0:00:28.61,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Metaphorically and literally, \Nshe is the brains of the Grievers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.61,0:00:31.99,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Once considered to be the \Nmost renowned alchemist,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.99,0:00:34.85,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,she's been given the second\Nname "The Prodigy."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.23,0:00:44.89,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Sometimes, she foists the results born of \Nher extraordinary knowledge and wisdom on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:47.70,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,You made this slime, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.70,0:00:49.91,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,I guess that makes this "Sitri's Slime."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.91,0:00:51.06,Flashback,Eva,0,0,0,,How imaginative.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.10,0:00:55.26,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,This really takes me back, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.26,0:00:59.09,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Back when we were little, we used to \Nhave fun by stepping on wild slimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:59.72,Flashback Top,Sitri,0,0,0,,You mustn't do that, Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:04.22,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,If you accidentally release it, \Nit might destroy the entire capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.69,0:01:07.04,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,It's just a little bit dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.29,0:01:08.99,Flashback,Eva,0,0,0,,Just a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:10.85,Flashback Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:13.80,Flashback Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Then this is one dangerous slime!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:16.93,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,Please make sure to handle \Nit with the appropriate care.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.93,0:01:19.98,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.42,0:01:25.16,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,We are now in the golden age \Nof the treasure hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.16,0:01:28.55,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Amid the sparkling talent on \Ndisplay in the capital of Zebrudia,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.55,0:01:31.34,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,there was one man who stood \Nout amongst all others!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.34,0:01:33.78,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,His name is Krai Andrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.78,0:01:36.49,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,This is an epic tale \Nfull of glory and agony,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.49,0:01:38.41,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,of how he became renowned \Nfor being the leader
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.41,0:01:41.40,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,of the strongest party he founded \Nwith his childhood friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.40,0:01:44.72,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,and also the master of the strongest clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.54,0:02:16.88,Internal,Eva,0,0,0,,There is a party in First Steps on the level \Nof Grieving Souls, Ark Brave, and Starlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.88,0:02:19.53,Internal,Eva,0,0,0,,Namely, the Obsidian Cross, \Nwhich is led by Stormstrike.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.53,0:02:22.53,EpTitle,title,0,0,0,,{\c&H00BAFF&\pos(320.52,100.623)}Episode 05
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.53,0:02:22.53,EpTitle,title,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\pos(322.143,238.714)\c&HD1D1D1&}I Want to Leave Everything to Ark
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.88,0:02:22.01,Default,title,0,0,0,,"I Want to Leave Everything to Ark."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.21,0:02:41.01,Show Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,700)\pos(324,269)\fscx95\fscy76}Let This Grieving Soul Retire
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.05,0:02:54.27,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I wanted to forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.19,0:02:57.57,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,But I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.14,0:02:59.98,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I can't find it anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:01.60,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.15,0:03:03.42,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.85,0:03:06.67,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Hey, please come out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.67,0:03:09.84,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Sitri's li'l Slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.72,0:03:14.83,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Now what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.16,0:03:17.92,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,No, I just need to think about this calmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.31,0:03:20.94,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,When I opened the capsule \Nin the White Wolf's Den,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.26,0:03:23.56,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,there was definitely nothing in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:28.42,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,And before that, it was in the safe all \Nthis time, and I've never opened it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.11,0:03:32.18,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Not to mention, the safe that I \Nkept it in is a relic itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.49,0:03:34.94,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,So that means there is only one conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.51,0:03:37.92,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It was always empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:39.24,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.57,0:03:42.37,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Sitri's such a joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.00,0:03:49.46,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,If I think about this anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.46,0:03:50.70,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I'm going to puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:57.47,Default,Kystel,0,0,0,,This was supposed to be a Level 3, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.47,0:04:02.58,Default,Mussai,0,0,0,,Apparently the phantoms' levels suddenly \Nwent up in the last two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.40,0:04:06.47,Default,Kystel,0,0,0,,The investigation missions from \Nthe Association sure aren't easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.47,0:04:12.98,Default,Mussai,0,0,0,,Investigating anomalies in treasure vaults \Nis important for the country as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:16.29,Default,Mussai,0,0,0,,They say that Thousand Tricks \Nis also looking into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.29,0:04:20.21,Default,Kystel,0,0,0,,Then that means there's something to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.46,0:04:29.41,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,In the end I could barely sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.51,0:04:32.40,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Krai?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:34.20,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.20,0:04:35.43,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,It's noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.79,0:04:39.68,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,The Association wants to hear a detailed \Nreport on the White Wolf's Den.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:43.88,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Tino was the leader, so ask her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:46.67,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I only got there at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.67,0:04:50.67,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Tino is training with Liz right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.67,0:04:53.05,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Working hard, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.92,0:04:57.57,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,But has there been any \Nmovement in the capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.57,0:04:59.74,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Movement?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.74,0:05:01.32,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.32,0:05:04.31,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,If there's been nothing, then that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.31,0:05:05.38,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.38,0:05:06.98,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,I'll look into it immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.98,0:05:08.61,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,No, no. You don't have to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.61,0:05:09.63,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:13.90,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'm probably just worrying over nothing, \Nso let's take it easy. Real easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.19,0:05:18.58,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Why don't I go check on Tino, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.58,0:05:20.71,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,They're in the training hall \Non basement level 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.20,0:05:22.52,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.39,0:05:25.81,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'll leave the rest to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.33,0:05:28.32,Internal,Eva(M),0,0,0,,From natural disasters like earthquakes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:29.69,Internal,Eva(M),0,0,0,,to anomalies in treasure vaults
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.69,0:05:32.19,Internal,Eva(M),0,0,0,,and squabbles amongst \Nthe capital's nobility,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:34.70,Internal,Eva(M),0,0,0,,he keeps accurately predicting \Nthings without any clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.70,0:05:36.60,Internal,Eva(M),0,0,0,,I've seen it time and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.91,0:05:39.83,Internal,Eva(M),0,0,0,,The first time could have been a coincidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.83,0:05:42.68,Internal,Eva(M),0,0,0,,but after the second or third, I'm certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:45.75,Internal,Eva(M),0,0,0,,What on earth is going on in our capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:51.86,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Can we do anything about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:05:56.74,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.74,0:05:58.14,Top Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Sven Anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.75,0:06:00.25,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(000,200)\bord2\fs15\pos(486.222,208.222)}"Stormstrike" \N{\u1\fs20}Sven Anger{\fs15\u0}\NHunter Level 6
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.14,0:06:00.25,Top Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,The leader of Obsidian Cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.25,0:06:02.98,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,You need to stop Stifled Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:04.75,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,We can't use the training hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.02,0:06:08.38,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Defeating monsters is not really \Nin my wheelhouse, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.64,0:06:12.25,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Ansem and Lucia aren't around either, \Nso there's nobody else who can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.64,0:06:15.33,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Why did she come back alone, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:19.28,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Apparently she disarmed trap after trap and \Nmade it all the way to the boss's chamber...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:22.12,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,But once there, she got bored and came home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:25.69,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Night Palace is a level 8 treasure vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.69,0:06:27.09,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,What do you mean, she "got bored"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.09,0:06:29.57,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,You Grievers are something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.35,0:06:32.27,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Well, that's neither here nor there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.55,0:06:35.49,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,If someone doesn't go in and \Nstop her, Tino's going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.14,0:06:38.28,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,An exaggeration, surely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:41.37,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,People don't die that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.35,0:06:47.91,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Tell me, Ti.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.91,0:06:50.08,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Why aren't you getting up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.08,0:06:51.92,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Is this all you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.92,0:06:54.51,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Or are you holding back?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.51,0:06:56.18,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Are you mocking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.44,0:06:58.05,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,You think I won't kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.05,0:06:59.13,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Because I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.13,0:07:00.80,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Is there nothing important to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.80,0:07:02.45,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Nothing you want to protect?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.75,0:07:04.60,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Why aren't you moving yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.94,0:07:07.20,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,If you won't give me your best, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.98,0:07:09.69,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.59,0:07:13.34,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,And we're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:16.33,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, Krai?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.70,0:07:19.72,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I'm giving Ti her lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.95,0:07:22.81,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,You know, Ti's got talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.81,0:07:24.94,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Maybe even more than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.45,0:07:27.54,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,But she's {\i1}so{\i0} weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:28.97,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.50,0:07:33.09,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,At her age, wasn't I so much stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.09,0:07:35.35,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, yes. You really were.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.77,0:07:39.47,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I understand your passion, but it \Nlooks like she's at her limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.47,0:07:41.51,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Let's call it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.51,0:07:42.60,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.15,0:07:46.60,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Krai, could you perhaps... be stopping me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.60,0:07:48.12,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.12,0:07:50.23,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,There's no {\i1}perhapsing{\i0} about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.53,0:07:56.49,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Then let's call it a day!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:08:01.26,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I could keep going,\Nbut if you insist, Krai...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:04.97,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Ti?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.39,0:08:07.93,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I'm talking to Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.19,0:08:14.01,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I can still move... Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.25,0:08:15.02,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:16.02,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Why that mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.26,0:08:17.85,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.85,0:08:20.63,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,She couldn't move at all before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.63,0:08:22.01,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,That's the power of Krai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.01,0:08:25.03,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I'm almost jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.31,0:08:27.33,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,L-Liz...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.03,0:08:29.81,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Let's go, Ti.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:33.53,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.53,0:08:37.02,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You know there's no talking to \NLiz once she gets like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.02,0:08:39.29,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,I guess there's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:42.80,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,And you've always been crazy\Ntough on them, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.80,0:08:44.30,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I've actually stopped—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.30,0:08:45.84,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Words are unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.84,0:08:49.91,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Tino getting stronger will \Nbe good for us as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.41,0:08:52.03,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I guess this works out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.03,0:08:53.64,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I won't say anything more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.64,0:08:54.93,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Hey, that reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.41,0:08:58.74,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,They say the northern route \Nhas been locked down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.74,0:08:59.59,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.35,0:09:02.92,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Multiple phantoms have appeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.18,0:09:04.96,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,So it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:07.68,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,They're investigating it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.68,0:09:11.69,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,It looks like the party from the \NKnight's Order got crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.69,0:09:16.80,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I heard about the travelers who got attacked\Nby phantoms from the White Wolf's Den.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.29,0:09:20.38,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Thinking about it, there was \Nsomething off about that as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.79,0:09:24.82,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Maybe that's why Gark wanted to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.13,0:09:28.59,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Why is Ark not here at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.93,0:09:31.05,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,He's strong. He's smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.05,0:09:33.75,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,People trust him so much more than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.75,0:09:35.07,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Too much, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.07,0:09:39.41,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,As a leader and also as a fighter, \Nhe leaves nothing to be desired.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:44.07,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,If I just leave all of this to Ark, \Neverything will go smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.07,0:09:46.19,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I hope he comes home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.19,0:09:49.62,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Until then, I'm going to do everything \NI can to stall for time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.98,0:09:52.48,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Cool as always, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.64,0:09:55.61,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Because this is absolutely not my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.48,0:09:58.58,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.58,0:10:00.94,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,If I send the Obsidian Cross to Gark,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.94,0:10:03.76,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,he can make them deal with all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.69,0:10:05.73,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Sven?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:06.34,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.34,0:10:09.99,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,If you can't use the training hall, how\Nabout doing a mission for the Association?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.19,0:10:14.29,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Also, please let Gark know that I'm busy, \Nso I won't be able to come see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.29,0:10:16.07,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,All right, gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.19,0:10:20.27,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I'm so sharp today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:23.08,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.08,0:10:26.08,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,You can never tell what he's thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:28.51,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,And he seems so... casual.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.96,0:10:31.27,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,What is he even {\i1}doing {\i0}all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.55,0:10:35.39,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,Why is the leader staying back while \Neveryone else is out on missions?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.72,0:10:38.29,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,He's always been like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.29,0:10:42.03,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,You're new, so you don't know that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.03,0:10:44.46,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,He keeps the Grievers going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:45.65,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,And this clan, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.05,0:10:48.68,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,I'll take your word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.55,0:10:52.96,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,I know you might not understand it yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.96,0:10:55.16,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,but there is no doubt that man is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.87,0:10:57.33,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,also a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.05,0:11:02.72,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,I'm not giving you an order or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.72,0:11:06.30,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,But don't underestimate him based \Non what you see on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.80,0:11:09.54,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,See what's beneath it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:11.25,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,That's what you're always doing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:12.05,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.03,0:11:19.73,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,There have been no changes in the \Nley lines near the White Wolf's Den.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.73,0:11:22.56,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,The amount of mana material \Nhasn't changed either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.82,0:11:26.26,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,So what caused the anomaly \Nin the treasure vault?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.69,0:11:28.45,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,What is the reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.45,0:11:30.22,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Could it be something artificial?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.62,0:11:32.28,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,No, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.34,0:11:35.72,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,I need to talk to Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:40.84,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,The Obsidian Cross let me know \Nthat Krai is too busy to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.84,0:11:42.85,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,I'll go visit him tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.85,0:11:44.10,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,That punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.10,0:11:45.50,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,He knows something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.50,0:11:46.72,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.72,0:11:48.19,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,Perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:51.57,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,First off, he hasn't set foot in \Na single treasure vault lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.57,0:11:54.92,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,yet this time, he took the trouble \Nto go out there and check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.92,0:11:57.73,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,That alone proves there's something going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:01.23,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,How unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.63,0:12:05.24,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,To think a high-level hunter \Nwould get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.78,0:12:08.62,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Not even a god could have predicted this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.97,0:12:14.20,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,It might only be a matter of time before the \NExplorers' Association discovers this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:19.50,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Which means Thousand Tricks is a man \Nyou must never underestimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.50,0:12:26.46,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,I cannot imagine that mere hunters \Ncould grasp the grand work you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.46,0:12:29.55,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,the grand Master of Mages, \Nhead of research of the capital's branch
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.55,0:12:32.55,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,of the Akashic Tower, are doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.56,0:12:38.67,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,However, until they discover \Nthe root cause of all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:41.06,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,they will not leave the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.62,0:12:49.15,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,This thing taps into the tremendous \Npower flowing through the ley lines,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.15,0:12:53.69,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,and by storing it here, it's causing \Nmodifications in the treasure vaults.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.33,0:12:59.13,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,If my experiment progresses \Nand proves my theory,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.13,0:13:03.85,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,we should even be able to create \Ntreasure vaults at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:07.62,Default,Hos,0,0,0,,Do we have no choice but to \Nabandon this research center?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:09.96,Default,Tage,0,0,0,,I can't believe we'll \Nhave to start all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.96,0:13:12.78,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,And why is Sophia on "vacation" right now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.78,0:13:14.34,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,What is she doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.34,0:13:17.24,Default,Nol,0,0,0,,She's the one in charge \Nof the defense system!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.47,0:13:18.98,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Don't get worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.98,0:13:21.38,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,I'm the one who granted her permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.98,0:13:25.47,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,I've contacted Sophia with \Nthe Sounding Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:27.00,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,She'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.18,0:13:30.00,Internal,Noctus(M),0,0,0,,Sophia Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:32.73,Internal,Noctus(M),0,0,0,,Vastly talented. My right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.25,0:13:35.70,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,If she were here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.70,0:13:39.37,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,she would certainly resolve \Nthis conundrum for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.37,0:13:42.29,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Either way, we need \Nto gather information for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.29,0:13:43.25,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.45,0:14:07.75,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.07,0:14:12.55,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It was a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.12,0:14:16.53,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Is Sitri's Slime really that dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.78,0:14:18.20,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:20.68,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It's not like my dreams ever come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.25,0:14:23.99,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.99,0:14:25.15,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Liz?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.39,0:14:28.79,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Good morning, Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.79,0:14:31.46,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I knew it was weirdly warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.77,0:14:36.32,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I guess Liz does have a habit of \Nsneaking into my bed at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.32,0:14:38.80,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,She really runs way too hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.70,0:14:41.32,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Hey, Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.63,0:14:42.78,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Are you free today?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.24,0:14:44.90,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,What about Tino's training?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.87,0:14:51.31,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I think she'll break if I go too hard, \Nso we're taking today off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.31,0:14:52.88,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,What about {\i1}your{\i0} training?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.31,0:14:55.57,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,We're taking today off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.17,0:14:58.54,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I'll forget about that nightmare for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:01.07,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Yup, it was just a nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.33,0:15:03.25,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Sure. Let's do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.25,0:15:04.34,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:06.65,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Thanks, Krai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.36,0:15:09.43,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.95,0:15:11.35,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.04,0:15:16.60,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,I can hardly believe that \Nyou came here personally...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.60,0:15:19.90,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,If I didn't, we'd be getting nowhere fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.90,0:15:22.43,Default,Entora,0,0,0,,May I ask you to wait for one moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.43,0:15:24.22,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:25.11,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.35,0:15:27.16,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,There you are, Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.85,0:15:30.74,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,But he's very busy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.74,0:15:32.17,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Liz!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.17,0:15:34.24,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,You're already back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.60,0:15:35.94,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.94,0:15:38.74,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I don't have time to change your diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:41.97,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,What happened with the Night Palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.97,0:15:46.24,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,I told you to make a report when you finish \Na treasure vault higher than level 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.24,0:15:47.00,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Shut your hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.28,0:15:50.72,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,And you guys are way too dependent on Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.72,0:15:53.64,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Learn how to change your \Nown diapers already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.91,0:15:56.89,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you think you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.89,0:15:59.61,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Like I care! You're ruining my date!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.61,0:16:01.33,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.71,0:16:03.54,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.16,0:16:08.78,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Even a friendly, mellow man \Nlike me has his limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.07,0:16:11.61,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Which part of you is friendly and mellow?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.02,0:16:17.53,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.53,0:16:20.52,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Kaina, shall we have some tea upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.13,0:16:22.53,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.07,0:16:28.79,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Hmm. So there was no\Nproblem with the ley lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.79,0:16:31.99,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,You went to the White Wolf's Den, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.99,0:16:32.86,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:35.67,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,If you noticed anything \Nunusual, please tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.14,0:16:39.17,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Not really, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.17,0:16:41.43,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,Not... really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:45.43,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'm more concerned with the {\i1}other{\i0} issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.43,0:16:46.81,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,What issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.81,0:16:47.84,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.11,0:16:51.08,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,Can you tell me about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.08,0:16:54.14,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't \Ntell you about it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.14,0:16:54.86,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.86,0:16:58.09,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I don't know who's got ears listening where.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.09,0:16:59.82,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.55,0:17:03.51,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,"I may have released a dangerous slime."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.51,0:17:06.08,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,There's no way I can say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.49,0:17:08.35,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I can't leave right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.35,0:17:11.51,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,but I'll have our clan help \Nout as much as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.82,0:17:17.34,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! This sounds like \Njust the thing for Ark!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:20.21,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, you should ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.48,0:17:22.24,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Forgive me, Kaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.65,0:17:26.47,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I'm useless and I suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.81,0:17:34.22,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Looks like you've gotten outta shape, Gark!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.22,0:17:36.48,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Sitting behind a desk will do that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.13,0:17:38.62,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Just keep talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.34,0:17:45.95,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,You've got to exercise more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.95,0:17:48.82,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Wait, did you put on weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:51.17,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:55.21,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,You've fallen off so hard that I feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.50,0:17:58.47,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,For old times' sake, I'll let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.77,0:18:00.89,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Aren't I nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.70,0:18:03.48,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,It looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.48,0:18:06.23,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,you need to be taught a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.48,0:18:11.22,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,You little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.51,0:18:14.34,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Looks like they're still at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.34,0:18:15.42,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.27,0:18:17.73,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Gark Welter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.18,0:18:21.96,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Currently, he is the head of the Zebrudia \Nbranch of the Explorers' Association,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.96,0:18:24.76,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,but he used to be a \Nfirst-rate level 7 hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.36,0:18:31.03,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,The people who knew him from \Nthen still whisper his second name,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.03,0:18:33.34,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,"War Demon," in awe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.58,0:18:37.22,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,All right, that's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.97,0:18:42.29,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,We're done with our talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.29,0:18:44.48,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Maybe you should calm down a bit, Gark.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.48,0:18:47.24,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,How could I be calm when—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.97,0:18:50.23,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Krai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.63,0:18:52.60,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.60,0:18:54.08,Internal,Gark(M),0,0,0,,When did she...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.83,0:18:56.24,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,Shall we go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.48,0:19:02.65,Internal,Gark(M),0,0,0,,I'll need to resume my training again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.39,0:19:10.14,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.14,0:19:12.63,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,What happened here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:20.45,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Gark's really gotten soft, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.45,0:19:23.28,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Old age is {\i1}so{\i0} cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.28,0:19:26.42,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I don't think he's particularly weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.64,0:19:30.30,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You shouldn't use yourself as a \Nmeasure when you're still on active duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.56,0:19:35.32,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,But he'd never get through \Nthe Night Palace like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:38.19,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,So were the phantoms really strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.19,0:19:39.08,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.08,0:19:40.61,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,The strongest so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.61,0:19:43.09,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Felt like a real level 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.20,0:19:47.34,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,How tough was it compared to \Nthe White Wolf Den's boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.75,0:19:50.79,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Huh? There was a boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:51.66,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.66,0:19:54.10,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Oh. I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.10,0:19:57.08,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I'm not good at remembering \Nthat kind of trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.10,0:20:01.21,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,So that boss wasn't even worth remembering.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.85,0:20:05.38,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Sitri and the others are \Nstill at the Night Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.38,0:20:07.88,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,It'd be great if they could come back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.25,0:20:12.48,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I'd really like to do something about \Nthat slime before it causes a commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.99,0:20:15.13,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Krai, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.13,0:20:16.88,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,You seem kinda down...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.88,0:20:18.36,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Hey, Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.36,0:20:18.99,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.99,0:20:21.31,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,This is just a hypothetical,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.31,0:20:24.85,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,but say the entire city of \NZebrudia got destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.85,0:20:25.99,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,What would you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.43,0:20:27.88,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Why not run away together?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.25,0:20:29.06,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.94,0:20:32.78,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I'd like to go somewhere in the tropics.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.78,0:20:36.24,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I mean, I've never seen the sea before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.24,0:20:39.01,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I'm talking about an entire \Ncountry being destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.01,0:20:41.09,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,and yet she's still so positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:43.34,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,But that's how Liz is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:45.27,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I need to learn from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.27,0:20:45.69,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.69,0:20:46.94,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Wait. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.53,0:20:54.28,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,L-Liz, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.28,0:20:57.31,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,This guy was staring at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.31,0:20:57.82,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.46,0:21:00.15,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.15,0:21:01.88,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Well, why don't we try to talk it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.00,0:21:06.03,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.44,0:21:08.38,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.28,0:21:16.24,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Wait, you were {\i1}allowing{\i0} him to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.24,0:21:17.05,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.05,0:21:19.88,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Oh, you're so good at acting!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.88,0:21:23.17,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I mean, I thought I was pretty \Ngood, but I couldn't even tell!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.42,0:21:25.45,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I'll be more careful next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.45,0:21:28.73,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,What is this girl talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:34.54,Internal,Joe,0,0,0,,What the hell just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.54,0:21:36.68,Internal,Joe,0,0,0,,I was tailing them from a safe distance!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.94,0:21:39.78,Internal,Joe,0,0,0,,Why did Thousand Tricks let me get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.78,0:21:41.32,Internal,Joe,0,0,0,,What was that supposed to be?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.32,0:21:42.68,Internal,Joe,0,0,0,,A warning?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.68,0:21:45.68,Internal,Joe,0,0,0,,Damn it, just how much does he know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.01,0:21:48.73,Internal,Nar,0,0,0,,The Akashic Tower is exhibiting \Nsome suspicious activity!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.73,0:21:52.71,Internal,Nar,0,0,0,,How will our Krai Andrey \Ndeal with this new threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.71,0:21:54.88,Internal,Nar,0,0,0,,Is this really the time for \Na carefree date?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:21:58.24,Internal,Nar,0,0,0,,And shouldn't he hurry to \Nlocate Sitri's Slime first?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.24,0:22:00.46,Internal,Nar,0,0,0,,Please tune in and find out next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.64,0:22:43.64,Top,Kaina,0,0,0,,First.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.63,0:22:58.64,EpTitle,sign,0,0,0,,{\fs15\pos(488.778,354.111)}By: Gark & Kaina
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.64,0:22:45.50,Top,Gark,0,0,0,,All his secrecy is no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.50,0:22:46.16,Top,Kaina,0,0,0,,Second.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.16,0:22:47.81,Top,Gark,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.81,0:22:48.50,Top,Kaina,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.50,0:22:49.91,Top,Gark,0,0,0,,He doesn't do anything himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.91,0:22:50.47,Top,Kaina,0,0,0,,Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.47,0:22:52.24,Top,Gark,0,0,0,,I call and call, but he never shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.24,0:22:53.02,Top,Kaina,0,0,0,,Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.02,0:22:54.72,Top,Gark,0,0,0,,I'm really about to lose it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.12,0:22:57.57,Top,Gark,0,0,0,,Next time, on {\i1}Let This Grieving Soul{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.57,0:22:59.26,Top,Both,0,0,0,,...{\i1}Retire{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.64,0:23:03.94,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\c&H00BAFF&\pos(320.52,100.623)}Episode 06
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.64,0:23:03.94,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\pos(322.143,238.714)\c&HD1D1D1&}I Want to Sleep Instead of Taking Charge
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.26,0:23:00.94,Top,Kaina,0,0,0,,Krai, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.94,0:23:03.04,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,"I Want to Sleep Instead of Taking Charge."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.73,0:23:07.69,Flashback,Sophia,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.00,0:23:11.92,Flashback,Sophia,0,0,0,,You are Noctus Cochlear, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.11,0:23:14.61,Flashback,Noctus,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.95,0:23:18.48,Flashback,Sophia,0,0,0,,I am Sophia Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.48,0:23:21.95,Flashback,Sophia,0,0,0,,I'd like you to take me on as an apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.37,0:23:25.02,Flashback,Noctus,0,0,0,,Sophia... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.02,0:23:29.22,Flashback,Noctus,0,0,0,,Are you asking with the awareness \Nof my current station?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.22,0:23:31.18,Flashback,Sophia,0,0,0,,Very much so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.52,0:23:34.32,Flashback,Sophia,0,0,0,,Your research is marvelous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.32,0:23:38.91,Flashback,Sophia,0,0,0,,My hope is that you can bestow\N on me a measure of the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.91,0:23:41.60,Flashback,Sophia,0,0,0,,you've been cultivating for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.15,0:23:44.62,Flashback,Noctus,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.95,0:23:48.83,Flashback,Sophia,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
